WEBVTT

NOTE Captions for t2-03-trust-betrayal.mp3 — machine-transcribed on-device from the existing audio (SR-472). Not proofread.
NOTE Cues with ids phase-recognise/-regulate/-release/-rise mark where each step begins; js/saferise-poster.js reads them.

00:00:02.190 --> 00:00:05.290
There is a clear line through your history now.

00:00:05.610 --> 00:00:08.060
A distinct before and after.

00:00:08.590 --> 00:00:11.520
And you can pinpoint the exact second.

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:13.000
The ground moved.

00:00:13.390 --> 00:00:18.050
Everything on the other side of that moment has been quietly re-indexed.

00:00:18.730 --> 00:00:24.720
Things you held a solid truth last month are now being re-examined for clues
you missed.

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:28.680
Nothing here is going to tell you how to resolve this.

00:00:29.370 --> 00:00:34.130
Not whether to repair the bond, walk away, or close the book.

00:00:34.480 --> 00:00:37.230
That territory belongs entirely to you.

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:51.600
The alarm in your body goes off instantly, long before your wiser steady mind
has time to process the blow.

00:00:52.070 --> 00:00:54.860
The real drain happens in that middle ground.

00:00:55.110 --> 00:00:57.730
Where panic tries to force a resolution.

00:01:05.190 --> 00:01:08.950
We are going to navigate this across four intentional phases.

phase-recognise
00:01:09.490 --> 00:01:10.440
Recognise.

00:01:11.050 --> 00:01:14.620
We begin by identifying where this fracture settles.

00:01:14.990 --> 00:01:16.330
In your physical body

00:01:16.970 --> 00:01:20.380
Feel the distinct somatic signature of shattered trust.

00:01:21.150 --> 00:01:23.610
A heavy burning sensation in the chest

00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:26.750
Combined with a sickening drop in the stomach.

00:01:27.120 --> 00:01:28.200
A tied jaw

00:01:28.570 --> 00:01:30.370
Or a restless agitation.

00:01:30.580 --> 00:01:31.890
That has nowhere to go

00:01:37.860 --> 00:01:40.110
Give this physical state a single word.

00:01:40.510 --> 00:01:41.510
Adjectated

00:01:41.950 --> 00:01:44.050
Observe what that word leaves out.

00:01:44.380 --> 00:01:46.010
It emits the other person.

00:01:46.240 --> 00:01:47.120
What they did

00:01:47.560 --> 00:01:48.640
When it started

00:01:48.890 --> 00:01:51.400
And the full inventory of their choices.

00:01:58.270 --> 00:02:01.080
That isn't because their actions are in doubt.

00:02:01.590 --> 00:02:02.970
The breach occurred.

00:02:03.410 --> 00:02:06.190
And this practice doesn't alter that fact.

00:02:06.720 --> 00:02:09.690
But there are two realities in you right now.

00:02:10.040 --> 00:02:12.140
And only one can be influenced.

00:02:12.850 --> 00:02:15.100
The record of what happened is fixed.

00:02:15.730 --> 00:02:20.990
But the visceral panic running through your chest is active and open to
change.

00:02:30.860 --> 00:02:33.780
Go one layer deeper, beneath the shop.

00:02:34.200 --> 00:02:38.670
The fundamental structure you relied on dissolved beneath your feet.

00:02:45.080 --> 00:02:48.170
Look closely at the primary driver underneath.

00:02:48.550 --> 00:02:50.620
Losing control over your life.

00:02:51.150 --> 00:02:53.790
Being left alone to manage the damage.

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:56.480
Taking on the shame of being the fool.

00:02:56.880 --> 00:02:59.190
Or running out of time to rebuild.

00:03:06.690 --> 00:03:09.790
Sink into that core vulnerability for a moment.

00:03:10.350 --> 00:03:11.920
Leave it right where it is.

00:03:12.400 --> 00:03:14.210
Nothing needs to be solved here.

phase-regulate
00:03:21.080 --> 00:03:21.900
Regulate

00:03:22.490 --> 00:03:25.030
Now we stabilize your physiology.

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:27.680
So you can hold this weight without breaking.

00:03:34.070 --> 00:03:36.200
Inhale slowly for four counts.

00:03:36.880 --> 00:03:39.430
And exhale smoothly for six counts.

00:03:39.990 --> 00:03:44.190
Ensure the breath out is noticeably longer than the breath in.

00:03:51.660 --> 00:03:55.480
Bring your focal point directly into the center of your chest.

00:03:56.290 --> 00:03:58.970
Your sleep has likely been disrupted.

00:03:59.220 --> 00:04:00.920
That is a natural response.

00:04:01.350 --> 00:04:09.110
The nervous system refuses to drop its guard because it believes the dark is
when you are most exposed.

00:04:15.420 --> 00:04:18.430
Intensive thoughts will loop continuously.

00:04:18.900 --> 00:04:22.710
Let each one surface without grabbing it, interrogating it.

00:04:23.020 --> 00:04:25.080
Or trying to trace it to the end.

00:04:31.360 --> 00:04:34.550
An arising thought is simply neural activity.

00:04:40.520 --> 00:04:43.710
It is not a demand to reach a conclusion tonight.

00:04:44.290 --> 00:04:48.000
If you catch yourself trying hard to heal, ease off.

00:04:54.020 --> 00:04:58.460
Striving is just the defense mechanism operating under a softer name.

00:05:05.930 --> 00:05:08.730
Rest here in this steady breathing pattern.

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:19.590
Whether passes through a room

00:05:25.420 --> 00:05:27.510
But the room remains whole.

00:05:34.640 --> 00:05:37.820
There are two separate operations running within you.

00:05:38.250 --> 00:05:40.650
And the first one is beyond debate.

00:05:47.450 --> 00:05:50.820
A real boundary was broken and it cost you deeply.

00:05:56.970 --> 00:06:00.660
But the second operation is the endless audit of the past.

00:06:01.140 --> 00:06:04.190
Re-evaluating every shared conversation.

00:06:04.480 --> 00:06:05.670
Every trip

00:06:05.900 --> 00:06:07.550
Every ordinary memory

00:06:08.200 --> 00:06:10.960
Searching for the early warnings you didn't see.

phase-release
00:06:11.490 --> 00:06:12.150
Release

00:06:20.090 --> 00:06:23.130
That audit will never yield a clean verdict.

00:06:23.760 --> 00:06:26.880
Once you view a history through the lens of suspicion,

00:06:27.250 --> 00:06:30.420
Every detail can be interpreted in two directions.

00:06:31.020 --> 00:06:33.450
You could inspect five years of history.

00:06:33.760 --> 00:06:35.890
I never find a stopping point.

00:06:36.360 --> 00:06:38.390
The betrayal remains a fact.

00:06:38.660 --> 00:06:41.930
But you can lay down the endless investigation.

00:06:49.960 --> 00:06:52.790
Dropping the audit doesn't mean forgiving.

00:06:53.160 --> 00:06:54.040
Forgetting

00:06:54.410 --> 00:06:56.190
Or admitting you were wrong.

00:06:56.680 --> 00:06:59.040
It simply means talking a search.

00:06:59.280 --> 00:07:01.100
That has no final page.

00:07:01.460 --> 00:07:03.230
Ask yourself this question.

00:07:03.690 --> 00:07:06.800
What was this hypervigilance built to protect?

00:07:07.260 --> 00:07:12.160
Your system went into red alert and hasn't felt safe enough to disarm.

00:07:12.600 --> 00:07:16.440
It is constantly monitoring tones, storing details.

00:07:16.740 --> 00:07:18.420
And scanning for deceit.

00:07:18.870 --> 00:07:26.250
That isn't paranoia, that is a protective system that was caught off guard
once and swore never again.

00:07:33.020 --> 00:07:35.460
You don't need all the answers right now.

00:07:41.430 --> 00:07:44.920
Keep the inquiry for when your body feels more secure.

00:07:51.810 --> 00:07:55.450
Put the primary fear that surfaced into your breath stream.

00:07:55.660 --> 00:07:56.680
And let it be.

00:08:06.560 --> 00:08:09.050
If it was the fear of losing control,

00:08:09.290 --> 00:08:13.110
Recognise that while you cannot control another's integrity,

00:08:13.580 --> 00:08:16.140
Your response remains entirely your own.

00:08:16.570 --> 00:08:21.250
If it was the fear of isolation, realize that holding your breath tonight.

00:08:21.500 --> 00:08:23.250
Will not determine who stays.

00:08:23.860 --> 00:08:26.630
None of this gets settled from inside the shock.

phase-rise
00:08:27.100 --> 00:08:27.750
Rise.

00:08:34.670 --> 00:08:38.120
Finally, we step into quiet, steady endurance.

00:08:38.790 --> 00:08:41.630
Visualize yourself from across the room.

00:08:47.840 --> 00:08:51.640
Carrying a heavy weight but standing with composure.

00:08:59.700 --> 00:09:05.810
You are right about the breach, but nothing needs to be finalized in this
exact hour.

00:09:14.570 --> 00:09:18.170
Now picture the version of yourself you want to embody.

00:09:18.510 --> 00:09:20.480
While this remains unresolved,

00:09:21.360 --> 00:09:24.110
Same pain, same unanswered questions.

00:09:24.870 --> 00:09:28.000
But you are the one deciding where your focus rests.

00:09:28.720 --> 00:09:30.920
Not unsearching for more evidence.

00:09:31.580 --> 00:09:34.610
But on anchoring in your immediate reality.

00:09:34.890 --> 00:09:36.700
And continuing forward.

00:09:43.230 --> 00:09:44.470
Where are you sitting?

00:09:44.930 --> 00:09:47.250
What can you physically touch right now?

00:09:47.650 --> 00:09:48.900
What is around you?

00:09:49.310 --> 00:09:52.240
Step directly into that present reality.

00:09:58.930 --> 00:10:02.850
The wound is still real, but your attention belongs to you.

00:10:09.330 --> 00:10:13.860
Choose one grounding action to take the next time the mental audit begins.

00:10:21.940 --> 00:10:24.200
Afterwards write down what shifted.

00:10:24.590 --> 00:10:26.190
Take one last slow breath.

00:10:26.740 --> 00:10:29.000
In for four and out for six.

00:10:35.930 --> 00:10:40.070
Feel the solid floor beneath you, gently move your hands in feet.

00:10:40.420 --> 00:10:42.920
And open your eyes when you are ready.

00:10:53.020 --> 00:10:54.820
Return to this anchor.

00:10:55.080 --> 00:10:58.850
Whenever you need to stand firm on shifty ground.
